{"seq":3,"slug":"eval-reliability-saturation","title":"评测可靠性与基准饱和","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/llm-evaluation-benchmarks/foundations/eval-reliability-saturation","wordCount":1996,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"评测可靠性与基准饱和\">评测可靠性与基准饱和</h1><p>一个 benchmark 上的高分数意味着什么？这个问题比表面上复杂得多。两个标注者评估同一个模型输出，可能给出完全不同的分数；同一个模型在 benchmark 上轻微改写题目后，分数可能大幅下降；整个领域的模型都接近满分了，这个 benchmark 还能告诉我们什么？评测的可靠性（reliability）——结果是否可重复、可信、有意义——是评测体系中经常被跳过但实际上极其重要的一环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>评测可靠性</strong>有三个层次的含义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>度量方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>标注者间一致性</strong></td>\n<td>两个人对同一个输出会给出相同评判吗？</td>\n<td>Fleiss κ, Cohen&#39;s κ, Krippendorff&#39;s α</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>测试集稳定性</strong></td>\n<td>题目轻微改写后，模型分数还稳定吗？</td>\n<td>扰动测试, bootstrap 置信区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>基准有效性</strong></td>\n<td>这个 benchmark 还能区分模型能力吗？</td>\n<td>天花板分析, 难度分布分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"标注者间一致性-inter-annotator-agreement\">标注者间一致性（Inter-Annotator Agreement）</h2><h3 id=\"为什么一致性至关重要\">为什么一致性至关重要</h3><p>标注数据是 benchmark 的地基，如果标注者之间对答案的判断高度不一致，benchmark 分数就是在量噪声而不是在量能力。这不是假设性的风险——研究者发现，在&quot;摘要质量&quot;、&quot;指令遵循程度&quot;、&quot;创意写作水平&quot;等主观评测任务中，标注者之间的原始一致率（raw agreement）可能只有 60-70%，而这意味着大量评测结论建立在沙子上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"cohen-s-kappa-与-fleiss-kappa\">Cohen&#39;s Kappa 与 Fleiss&#39; Kappa</h3><p><strong>Cohen&#39;s Kappa（κ）</strong> 衡量两个标注者之间的一致性，扣除了随机一致性的影响：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa = \\frac{p_o - p_e}{1 - p_e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是观察到的一致比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是期望的随机一致比例。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.metrics import cohen_kappa_score&#10;&#10;# 两个标注者对 10 个样本的评分（1-5 分）&#10;annotator_1 = [4, 3, 5, 2, 4, 3, 5, 1, 4, 3]&#10;annotator_2 = [4, 4, 5, 2, 3, 3, 4, 1, 5, 3]&#10;&#10;kappa = cohen_kappa_score(annotator_1, annotator_2,&#10;                           weights=&#39;quadratic&#39;)  # 加权 kappa 对偏差敏感&#10;print(f&quot;Cohen&#39;s Kappa: {kappa:.3f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.metrics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohen_kappa_score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 两个标注者对 10 个样本的评分（1-5 分）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">annotator_1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">annotator_2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kappa </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohen_kappa_score(annotator_1, annotator_2,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                           weights</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'quadratic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 加权 kappa 对偏差敏感</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Cohen's Kappa: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kappa</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.3f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Fleiss&#39; Kappa</strong> 是 Cohen&#39;s Kappa 向多标注者的推广，用于 N 个标注者对同一批样本打分的情况：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mtext>Fleiss</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa_{\\text{Fleiss}} = \\frac{\\bar{P} - \\bar{P}_e}{1 - \\bar{P}_e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Fleiss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3572em;vertical-align:-0.8601em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4971em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2899em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8601em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>Kappa 值的解读标准（Landis &amp; Koch, 1977）：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Kappa 范围</th>\n<th>一致性程度</th>\n<th>评测含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 0.00</td>\n<td>差于随机</td>\n<td>benchmark 数据质量有根本问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.00–0.20</td>\n<td>轻微</td>\n<td>标注任务定义不清，结论不可信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.21–0.40</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n<td>可以用但需要报告置信区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.41–0.60</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>可接受的基准（大多数 NLP 评测在此范围）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.61–0.80</td>\n<td>实质</td>\n<td>良好，可以支持有意义的结论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.81–1.00</td>\n<td>几乎完美</td>\n<td>高质量标注，结论可靠</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"提升标注一致性的工程实践\">提升标注一致性的工程实践</h3><p><strong>标注指南的详细程度直接影响 kappa 值。</strong> &quot;好的摘要&quot;是主观的，&quot;包含原文所有关键实体、无事实性错误、不超过原文字数 30%&quot;是可操作的。几条实用规则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>提供锚定示例（anchor examples）：</strong> 每个分数级别至少给出 2-3 个代表性样本，让标注者有具体参照。</li>\n<li><strong>标注前对齐（calibration round）：</strong> 正式标注前，全体标注者先对同一批 30-50 个样本打分，集体讨论分歧，统一理解。</li>\n<li><strong>难例单独处理：</strong> 把一致性低的样本打标为&quot;困难样本&quot;，交给专家或多数投票决定，而不是简单平均。</li>\n<li><strong>定期重测信度（intra-rater reliability）：</strong> 把 5-10% 的样本悄悄重复给同一个标注者，测量其自身前后的一致性。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"测试集稳定性\">测试集稳定性</h2><h3 id=\"脆性问题-brittleness\">脆性问题（Brittleness）</h3><p>一个可靠的评测，在测试题目轻微改变时，模型的分数应该保持大致稳定。但现实是，许多模型展现出极强的脆性（brittleness）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"原题：巴黎是哪个国家的首都？&#10;模型：法国 ✓&#10;&#10;改写：法国的首都是哪个城市？&#10;模型：里昂 ✗（这个问题很多模型的准确率下降 20%+）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>原题：巴黎是哪个国家的首都？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>模型：法国 ✓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>改写：法国的首都是哪个城市？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>模型：里昂 ✗（这个问题很多模型的准确率下降 20%+）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种脆性暴露了模型没有真正理解问题，而是在做模式匹配。当 benchmark 结果用于支持&quot;模型具备某某能力&quot;这样的结论时，脆性测试是必须做的稳健性检验。</p>\n<h3 id=\"bootstrap-置信区间\">Bootstrap 置信区间</h3><p>benchmark 分数点估计（如&quot;准确率 85.3%&quot;）不带不确定性信息，实际上所有分数都有抽样误差。Bootstrap 方法可以估计置信区间：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def bootstrap_confidence_interval(&#10;    correct: list[bool],&#10;    n_bootstrap: int = 1000,&#10;    ci: float = 0.95&#10;) -&gt; tuple[float, float, float]:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    计算评测准确率的 bootstrap 置信区间。&#10;&#10;    返回 (下界, 点估计, 上界)&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    correct_array = np.array(correct)&#10;    point_estimate = correct_array.mean()&#10;&#10;    bootstrap_means = []&#10;    for _ in range(n_bootstrap):&#10;        sample = np.random.choice(correct_array,&#10;                                   size=len(correct_array),&#10;                                   replace=True)&#10;        bootstrap_means.append(sample.mean())&#10;&#10;    alpha = 1 - ci&#10;    lower = np.percentile(bootstrap_means, 100 * alpha / 2)&#10;    upper = np.percentile(bootstrap_means, 100 * (1 - alpha / 2))&#10;&#10;    return lower, point_estimate, upper&#10;&#10;# 使用示例&#10;results = [True, True, False, True, ...] * 100  # 500 个样本&#10;lower, mean, upper = bootstrap_confidence_interval(results)&#10;print(f&quot;准确率: {mean:.1%} (95% CI: [{lower:.1%}, {upper:.1%}])&quot;)&#10;# 输出: 准确率: 85.3% (95% CI: [82.1%, 88.4%])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bootstrap_confidence_interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    correct: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n_bootstrap: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ci: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.95</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> tuple[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    计算评测准确率的 bootstrap 置信区间。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    返回 (下界, 点估计, 上界)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    correct_array </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array(correct)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    point_estimate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> correct_array.mean()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bootstrap_means </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n_bootstrap):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sample </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.choice(correct_array,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                                   size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(correct_array),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                                   replace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        bootstrap_means.append(sample.mean())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lower </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.percentile(bootstrap_means, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    upper </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.percentile(bootstrap_means, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lower, point_estimate, upper</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 500 个样本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lower, mean, upper </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bootstrap_confidence_interval(results)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"准确率: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.1%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> (95% CI: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.1%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">upper</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.1%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">])\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出: 准确率: 85.3% (95% CI: [82.1%, 88.4%])</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>实际意义：</strong> 如果模型 A 在 benchmark 上得 85.3%，模型 B 得 84.8%，这两个分数的置信区间很可能重叠，说明两个模型在这个测试集上没有统计显著差异。很多排行榜上看似的领先优势，其实在统计上不显著。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基准饱和-benchmark-saturation\">基准饱和（Benchmark Saturation）</h2><h3 id=\"饱和的定义\">饱和的定义</h3><p>当 benchmark 上的最佳模型成绩接近人类水平或满分（&gt;95%），并且大多数主流模型都聚集在高分区间时，这个 benchmark 就达到了<strong>饱和</strong>。饱和的 benchmark 失去了区分能力——你无法用它判断模型 A 比模型 B 好多少，因为所有模型的分数都差不多。</p>\n<h3 id=\"主流-benchmark-的饱和历程\">主流 Benchmark 的饱和历程</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"benchmark 寿命曲线（示意）：&#10;&#10;分数&#10;100% ┤         ████████████ ← 饱和区（区分度消失）&#10;     │       ███&#10; 95% ┤      ██&#10;     │     ██&#10; 90% ┤    ██ ← 有效评测窗口&#10;     │   ██&#10; 85% ┤  ██&#10;     │ ██&#10; 80% ┤██&#10;     └─────────────────────→ 时间&#10;      发布  一年  两年  三年\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>benchmark 寿命曲线（示意）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>分数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>100% ┤         ████████████ ← 饱和区（区分度消失）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     │       ███</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 95% ┤      ██</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     │     ██</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 90% ┤    ██ ← 有效评测窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     │   ██</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 85% ┤  ██</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     │ ██</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 80% ┤██</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     └─────────────────────→ 时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      发布  一年  两年  三年</span></span></code></pre></div><p>典型案例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>GLUE（2018）：</strong> 发布时人类水平约 87 分，2020 年主流模型已超越人类，被 SuperGLUE 取代。</li>\n<li><strong>SuperGLUE（2019）：</strong> 2021 年被 GPT-3 规模的模型超越。</li>\n<li><strong>MMLU（2020）：</strong> 截至 2024 年，GPT-4 级别的模型在 5-shot 设置下已达 87%+ 的准确率，接近饱和。</li>\n<li><strong>HumanEval（2021）：</strong> 主流模型 pass@1 已超 90%，难以区分前沿模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"应对饱和的策略\">应对饱和的策略</h3><p><strong>策略一：提升难度</strong></p>\n<p>把现有题目扩展到更难的版本。GSM8K 的难版本 GSM-Symbolic（哈佛版本，用符号替换数字）和 GSM-IC（加入无关信息干扰），把当前 SOTA 的准确率从 90%+ 打回到 50%，重新产生了区分度。</p>\n<p><strong>策略二：任务升级</strong></p>\n<p>从单步 Q&amp;A 升级到多步工具使用、代码执行、真实世界任务。SWE-bench 相比 HumanEval 的进步，正是从&quot;写一个函数&quot;升级到&quot;修复真实代码仓库中的 bug&quot;，难度大幅提升。</p>\n<p><strong>策略三：持续更新</strong></p>\n<p>定期向 benchmark 注入新数据，避免污染积累导致的分数虚高。LiveCodeBench 的做法是每月从 LeetCode/Codeforces 抓取新题目，确保测试集始终包含模型训练截止之后的新题目。</p>\n<p><strong>策略四：多维度分解</strong></p>\n<p>不追求单一的&quot;综合分数&quot;，而是把能力分解到细粒度子维度。MMLU 的 57 个子任务允许你看到模型在&quot;医学伦理&quot;上 90% 但在&quot;量子力学&quot;上只有 60%，这种细分分析比总分更有信息量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"判断一个-benchmark-是否仍然有效的检查清单\">判断一个 benchmark 是否仍然有效的检查清单</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"□ 最佳模型分数是否低于 85%？（高于则可能饱和）&#10;□ 不同能力级别的模型分数是否有足够的分散度？&#10;□ benchmark 发布时间是否晚于最新主流模型的训练截止日期？&#10;□ 是否有公开的污染检测报告或机制？&#10;□ 题目难度分布是否覆盖多个难度级别（而不是全是中等难度）？&#10;□ 评测结论是否得到了其他 benchmark 或人工评测的交叉验证？\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>□ 最佳模型分数是否低于 85%？（高于则可能饱和）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>□ 不同能力级别的模型分数是否有足够的分散度？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>□ benchmark 发布时间是否晚于最新主流模型的训练截止日期？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>□ 是否有公开的污染检测报告或机制？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>□ 题目难度分布是否覆盖多个难度级别（而不是全是中等难度）？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>□ 评测结论是否得到了其他 benchmark 或人工评测的交叉验证？</span></span></code></pre></div><p>可靠性判断可以拆成一条逐级下探的检查链：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;原始评测结果&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;标注者间一致性&lt;br/&gt;Fleiss κ &gt; 0.4？&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| B1[&quot;标注质量不足&lt;br/&gt;结论不可信&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C{&quot;分数差异落在&lt;br/&gt;置信区间之外？&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|重叠| C1[&quot;差异不显著&lt;br/&gt;不能解读为能力差距&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|不重叠| D{&quot;最佳模型分数&lt;br/&gt;&lt; 85%？&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[&quot;仍在有效区间&lt;br/&gt;可支持结论&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[&quot;基准已饱和&lt;br/&gt;换更难或更新的基准&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"原始评测结果\"] --&gt; B{\"标注者间一致性&lt;br/&gt;Fleiss κ &gt; 0.4？\"}\n    B --&gt;|否| B1[\"标注质量不足&lt;br/&gt;结论不可信\"]\n    B --&gt;|是| C{\"分数差异落在&lt;br/&gt;置信区间之外？\"}\n    C --&gt;|重叠| C1[\"差异不显著&lt;br/&gt;不能解读为能力差距\"]\n    C --&gt;|不重叠| D{\"最佳模型分数&lt;br/&gt;&lt; 85%？\"}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[\"仍在有效区间&lt;br/&gt;可支持结论\"]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[\"基准已饱和&lt;br/&gt;换更难或更新的基准\"]</pre><h2 id=\"综合可靠性框架\">综合可靠性框架</h2><p>在实践中，评测可靠性不是单一数字，而是一套综合性的判断。下面是一个报告评测结论时可以遵循的完整性清单：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可靠性要素</th>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>报告格式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标注质量</td>\n<td>Fleiss κ &gt; 0.4</td>\n<td>&quot;标注者间 kappa = 0.62 (n=3 标注者)&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本量</td>\n<td>置信区间宽度 &lt; 3%</td>\n<td>&quot;95% CI: [82.1%, 85.5%]&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统计显著性</td>\n<td>差异不在 CI 重叠区</td>\n<td>&quot;p &lt; 0.05, 效果量 d = 0.34&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>污染控制</td>\n<td>n-gram 重叠率 &lt; 1%</td>\n<td>&quot;训练集 13-gram 重叠率 0.3%&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鲁棒性</td>\n<td>扰动后分数波动 &lt; 5%</td>\n<td>&quot;改写版本分数 83.2% ± 2.1%&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>饱和状态</td>\n<td>分数 &lt; 85% 或有对照</td>\n<td>&quot;当前 SOTA 84.7%，仍在有效区间&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>标注者间一致性（Fleiss kappa）是 benchmark 数据质量的基础指标；kappa &lt; 0.4 的标注数据建立的 benchmark 结论不可信。</li>\n<li>提升标注质量的关键是：详细的可操作指南、锚定示例、标注前对齐校准轮次。</li>\n<li>所有 benchmark 分数都是点估计，应报告 bootstrap 置信区间；统计上不显著的分数差距不应被解读为能力差距。</li>\n<li>Benchmark 饱和（最佳模型 &gt;95% 准确率）会使 benchmark 丧失区分能力，应对策略包括提升难度、升级到真实世界任务、持续注入新数据。</li>\n<li>脆性测试（轻微改写题目后再测）是验证模型是否真正理解任务还是做模式匹配的关键工具。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"评测可靠性与基准饱和","id":"评测可靠性与基准饱和"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"标注者间一致性（Inter-Annotator Agreement）","id":"标注者间一致性-inter-annotator-agreement"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么一致性至关重要","id":"为什么一致性至关重要"},{"level":3,"text":"Cohen's Kappa 与 Fleiss' Kappa","id":"cohen-s-kappa-与-fleiss-kappa"},{"level":3,"text":"提升标注一致性的工程实践","id":"提升标注一致性的工程实践"},{"level":2,"text":"测试集稳定性","id":"测试集稳定性"},{"level":3,"text":"脆性问题（Brittleness）","id":"脆性问题-brittleness"},{"level":3,"text":"Bootstrap 置信区间","id":"bootstrap-置信区间"},{"level":2,"text":"基准饱和（Benchmark Saturation）","id":"基准饱和-benchmark-saturation"},{"level":3,"text":"饱和的定义","id":"饱和的定义"},{"level":3,"text":"主流 Benchmark 的饱和历程","id":"主流-benchmark-的饱和历程"},{"level":3,"text":"应对饱和的策略","id":"应对饱和的策略"},{"level":3,"text":"判断一个 benchmark 是否仍然有效的检查清单","id":"判断一个-benchmark-是否仍然有效的检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"综合可靠性框架","id":"综合可靠性框架"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"评测指标分类学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/llm-evaluation-benchmarks/foundations/metrics-taxonomy"},"next":{"title":"自动化评测指标实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/llm-evaluation-benchmarks/methods/automated-metrics"}}